// The limited form's question step (kinds/question.kind here): the owner's, straight from the asker, as `coord ask`
// reached him before Docket (paper-research m1586, 1).
call ask_owner(ask: Text, context: Text?) -> Answer(text: Text) | Dismiss(why: Text)
  task answer
  template
    {{ ask }}
    {{ if context }}

    {{ context }}
    {{ end }}
